B.Md=new A.f2("luteal","the luteal phase","The luteal phase is the stretch after ovulation and before a period, in a textbook cycle. It is often described as about 14 days, and that length is an estimate, not a measurement of you.","Progesterone is the hormone textbooks describe as rising then falling in that stretch. The fall is one reason people talk about mood, sleep, and cramps then.","Pain that is new, one-sided, or the worst you have felt belongs with a clinician, not with a phase name.","Which of my dates would you use, and what would you want logged before the next visit?",B.Ph)
B.acQ=s(["ACOG","NHS","RCOG"],t.s)
B.N_=s(["pms","premenstrual","before","period","bloating","mood"],t.s)
B.Ms=new A.f2("pms","PMS","PMS is a name for symptoms that show up in the days before a period and ease once bleeding starts. Naming it is not a diagnosis.","Textbooks discuss mood, bloating, breast tenderness, and cramps in that window. The same symptoms have other causes.","If the days before a period stop you from working, sleeping, or feeling safe, take that to a clinician.","Which symptoms should I write down, and for how many cycles?",B.N_)
B.acU=s(["NHS","ACOG","MedlinePlus"],t.s)
B.R5=s(["headache","headaches","migraine","pain","before","period"],t.s)
B.Mp=new A.f2("headache","headaches around a cycle","Some people notice headaches in the days before a period. That pattern is discussed in cycle education. It is not a finding that you have migraine.","Hormone change is one discussed reason. Sleep, skipped meals, and stress are others.","A sudden worst-ever headache, or a headache with vision changes, weakness, confusion, or a stiff neck, needs urgent care.","Which days should I mark, and when would you want me to be seen sooner?",B.R5)
B.acR=s(["ACOG","NHS","WHO"],t.s)
B.QW=s(["cramp","cramps","pain","period","bleeding","prostaglandin"],t.s)
B.Mq=new A.f2("cramps","period cramps","Cramps are often discussed with a period, when the uterus contracts. A cramp is not, by itself, a diagnosis.","Prostaglandins are the chemicals textbooks mention. Heavier bleeding can come with stronger cramps for some people.","Pain that makes you faint, or bleeding you cannot manage, needs urgent care.","What level of pain or bleeding would you want me to report before the next routine visit?",B.QW)
B.acV=s(["NHS","ACOG","Verity"],t.s)
B.RL=s(["pcos","androgen","insulin","weight","cycle","acne"],t.s)
B.Mo=new A.f2("pcos","PCOS","PCOS is a clinical diagnosis. Reading about irregular cycles, acne, hair growth, or weight does not mean you have it.","Androgens and insulin are the pathways clinicians discuss. They are not something a chat can measure.","A clinician uses your history and, when useful, labs or an ultrasound. An app does not make that call.","Which of these symptoms matter for the diagnosis you use, and which labs would you draw?",B.RL)
B.acS=s(["ACOG","NICE","NICHD"],t.s)
B.OD=s(["fertile","fertility","ovulation","conceive","bbt","basal","temperature"],t.s)
B.Mk=new A.f2("fertility","the fertile window","A fertile window in this app is a calendar estimate around an estimated ovulation day. It is not contraception and not a promise of pregnancy.","Sperm can survive for days, which is why education describes a window rather than one hour. A calendar cannot see an egg.","If you have been trying and want a plan, a clinician can talk about tests. This reply will not rank your chances.","Which dates and home tests, if any, would you want me to bring?",B.OD)
B.NK=s(["pregnancy","pregnant","week","trimester","due","kicks"],t.s)
B.Mg=new A.f2("pregnancy","pregnancy dating","Clinical dating often starts from the first day of the last menstrual period. This app will not confirm a pregnancy from a symptom.","A home test and a clinician are how a pregnancy is confirmed. Week notes are education after you save that date.","Heavy bleeding, severe pain, or a baby who is much quieter than usual needs same-day care.","Which symptoms should make me call the same day?",B.NK)
B.ad0=s(["NHS","The Menopause Society","NICE"],t.s)
B.Ob=s(["menopause","perimenopause","hot","flash","flashes","heat"],t.s)
B.Ml=new A.f2("menopause","the menopause transition","Hot flashes, broken sleep, and cycle changes are commonly discussed in the menopause transition. They are also non-specific.","Estrogen change is the pathway textbooks describe. An app cannot date menopause from one hot night.","Hormone therapy is a clinician decision that depends on your history.","Which of my heat and sleep notes would change what you recommend?",B.Ob)
B.acX=s(["NHS","CDC","MedlinePlus"],t.s)
B.Pi=s(["sleep","insomnia","tired","night","hours","rest"],t.s)
B.Mr=new A.f2("sleep","sleep","Sleep is often discussed alongside mood, pain, and a cycle. A note of hours is your log, not a sleep study.","Short nights can sit next to stronger symptoms for some people. That is a comparison of logs, not a cause this app can prove.","Snoring, gasping, or sleep that never feels refreshing is worth a visit.","Which nights should I write down before we talk about sleep?",B.Pi)
B.acY=s(["NHS","Academy of Nutrition and Dietetics"],t.s)
B.NL=s(["food","eat","nutrition","hungry","craving","protein","iron"],t.s)
B.Mj=new A.f2("food","food and a cycle","Appetite is often discussed in the days before a period. This reply will not set a calorie target or a supplement dose.","Iron, protein, and regular meals are the food topics clinicians mention around heavy bleeding and fatigue. The dose, if any, is theirs.","A restricted pattern, fainting, or a worry that food is taking over belongs with a clinician.","Do you want a food record, or is the bleeding the part to discuss first?",B.NL)
B.acN=s(["ACOG","NHS"],t.s)
B.QH=s(["exercise","training","workout","run","lift","fitness"],t.s)
B.Mh=new A.f2("training","training","Textbook writing sometimes calls some cycle days stronger for hard work and some days better for familiar work. That is not a clearance.","Energy and cramps change what a workout feels like. Pain is a reason to stop, not a phase to push through.","A clinician clears exercise in pregnancy and after any injury. This reply does not.","Which symptoms should make me skip a session?",B.QH)
B.acZ=s(["ACOG","NHS","Endometriosis UK"],t.s)
B.On=s(["endometriosis","endo","pelvic","pain","period"],t.s)
B.Mi=new A.f2("endometriosis","endometriosis","Endometriosis is tissue similar to the uterine lining growing outside the uterus. Pain with periods is a common story, and a normal ultrasound does not always rule it out.","The diagnosis is clinical. An app can hold the dates. It cannot make the call.","Pain that stops daily life is a reason to ask for a referral, not a reason to wait for an app to agree.","What would you need in the history before considering endometriosis?",B.On)
B.OL=s(["postpartum","after","birth","recovery","bleeding","mood"],t.s)
B.Mf=new A.f2("postpartum","postpartum","The weeks after birth are a recovery, and they are not a score. Bleeding, mood, and sleep can be written down. This app does not grade them.","Heavy mood on several days is a reason to tell a clinician. Urgent bleeding or fainting is emergency care.","Soaking a pad quickly, fainting, or thoughts of harm need emergency services, not a chat.","Which bleeding or mood changes should I call about before the next visit?",B.OL)
B.acT=s(["MedlinePlus","NHS","NICHD"],t.s)
B.R_=s(["ferritin","iron","tsh","thyroid","estradiol","progesterone","amh","lab","labs"],t.s)
B.Me=new A.f2("labs","a lab result","A lab is a number, a range printed on the report, a date, and a reason. The verdict stays with the clinician who ordered it.","Ferritin, TSH, estradiol, progesterone, and AMH answer different questions. A single number without that context is easy to misread.","Do not start or stop a medicine from a chat. Bring the page.","What day was this drawn, which range are you using, and does it need a repeat?",B.R_)
