B.Ol=s(["discharge","mucus","cervical","fluid","infection","color"],t.s)
B.Mm=new A.f2("discharge","discharge","Discharge changes across a cycle. Clear and stretchy fluid is often described near a fertile window. Color alone cannot name an infection.","Brown at the edges of a period is often older blood. Yellow-green, gray, a strong odor, itching, or pelvic pain is a clinician visit.","This reply will not name an infection from a sentence.","Which changes in color, smell, or comfort would you want to see me for?",B.Ol)
