B.RZ=s(["fibroid","fibroids","heavy","bleeding","uterus","pressure"],t.s)
B.Mn=new A.f2("fibroids","fibroids","Fibroids are growths of uterine muscle. They are common, and they are diagnosed by a clinician, often with imaging. Heavy bleeding or pressure is the story people bring.","Size and place change whether they matter. A chat cannot see them.","Bleeding that soaks through, or pain with fever, needs care sooner than a routine visit.","Would imaging change anything for the bleeding I am describing?",B.RZ)
