B.MD=new A.jT("cycle-length","A usual cycle length","ACOG calls a cycle length usual when it is 21 to 35 days, from one period start to the next. One saved date is not a completed cycle. A usual length is not a diagnosis.","ACOG menstruation ranges. EVA uses this same 21\u201335 day range on Today.")
B.My=new A.jT("period-length","How long a period usually lasts","ACOG calls a period usual when the bleed lasts 2 to 7 days. That is the bleed length you saved, not a finding about your health.","ACOG menstruation ranges. EVA uses this same 2\u20137 day range for the period badge.")
