B.MB=new A.jT("fertile","A fertile window is a calendar","Wilcox and colleagues (NEJM 1995) studied conception from intercourse in a six-day window ending on urine-dated ovulation, among people trying to conceive. EVA will not print that study as your personal chance. It is not contraception.","Wilcox et al., New England Journal of Medicine, 1995. Cited in EVA readings.")
